# Scoped build context for the Nakama runtime image.
#
# BuildKit prefers <dockerfile-path>.dockerignore over the root .dockerignore.
# The root file whitelists only nakama/package.json (all colyseus needs), which
# is not enough to bundle the runtime. Keep this in sync with ./Dockerfile.

*
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!contracts/**
!colyseus-server/package.json
!nakama/**

# Never ship local installs or prior build output into the context.
contracts/node_modules
contracts/dist
nakama/node_modules
nakama/build
nakama/coverage
**/.DS_Store
